UML DESIGN DOCUMENT
HỆ THỐNG QUẢN LÝ CÔNG VIỆC CÁ NHÂN
(TASK MANAGEMENT SYSTEM)
Activity Diagram – Sequence Diagram – Class Diagram
 
1. Mục tiêu thiết kế
Tài liệu chuyển các yêu cầu SRS và bộ 24 Use Case của Hệ thống Quản lý Công việc cá nhân trên nền tảng Web thành thiết kế UML. Nội dung gồm 6 Activity Diagram, 7 Sequence Diagram và 1 Class Diagram tổng thể, đồng thời kiểm tra truy vết từ SRS → Use Case → UML → Database.
2. Phạm vi và nguyên tắc thiết kế
Thiết kế bám theo tài liệu Buổi 4: không vẽ cả 24 Activity Diagram mà chọn 6 luồng nghiệp vụ quan trọng; 7 Sequence Diagram tập trung vào các luồng có tương tác Controller → Service → Repository; Class Diagram mô hình hóa Entity, Controller, Service và Repository.
3. Kiến trúc tổng quan
Web Browser
      ↓
Controller Layer
      ↓
Service Layer
      ↓
Repository Layer
      ↓
Entity / Database
      ↓
MySQL
Layer	Các lớp	Trách nhiệm
Controller	UserController, CategoryController, TaskController, NotificationController, AdminController	Nhận request và trả response.
Service	UserService, CategoryService, TaskService, NotificationService, AdminService	Business logic, validation, ownership, authorization.
Repository	UserRepository, CategoryRepository, TaskRepository, NotificationRepository, ActivityLogRepository, SettingRepository	Truy cập database.
Entity	User, Category, Task, Notification, ActivityLog, Setting	Mô hình dữ liệu nghiệp vụ.

4. Activity Diagram
Mã	Activity Diagram	Use Case liên quan
AD01	Đăng ký và đăng nhập	UC01, UC02
AD02	Tạo công việc	UC10
AD03	Cập nhật / hoàn thành công việc	UC11, UC17
AD04	Tìm kiếm và lọc công việc	UC13, UC14, UC15
AD05	Thiết lập Reminder	UC16
AD06	Xóa tài khoản	UC24

AD01 – Đăng ký và đăng nhập
UC01 cho phép Guest đăng ký; UC02 cho phép Guest đăng nhập. Sau khi đăng nhập hệ thống kiểm tra Role và chuyển tới Dashboard.
@startuml
title AD01 - Register / Login
start
:Open Task Management System;
if (Register or Login?) then (Register)
  :Enter full name, email and password;
  :Validate input;
  if (Valid?) then (Yes)
    :Create User;
    :Show registration success;
    :Redirect to Login;
  else (No)
    :Show validation error;
    stop
  endif
else (Login)
  :Enter email and password;
  :Authenticate account;
  if (Valid credentials?) then (Yes)
    :Create session/token;
    :Check user role;
    :Redirect to Dashboard;
  else (No)
    :Show login error;
    stop
  endif
endif
stop
@enduml
AD02 – Tạo Task
UC10 yêu cầu User đăng nhập, nhập thông tin Task, Category tùy chọn, Priority, Deadline và Reminder tùy chọn trước khi lưu.
@startuml
title AD02 - Create Task
start
:Select Create Task;
:Enter task information;
:Select Category (optional);
:Select Priority;
:Enter Deadline;
if (Set Reminder?) then (Yes)
  :Select Reminder Time;
endif
:Validate Task data;
if (Data valid?) then (Yes)
  :Save Task;
  if (Reminder enabled?) then (Yes)
    :Create Notification;
  endif
  :Show success message;
else (No)
  :Show validation error;
  :Return to Task form;
endif
stop
@enduml
AD03 – Cập nhật / hoàn thành Task
UC11 cho phép cập nhật Task; UC17 là trường hợp đánh dấu Completed và được mô hình hóa là mở rộng của UC11.
@startuml
title AD03 - Update / Complete Task
start
:Select Task;
:Check ownership;
if (Authorized?) then (No)
  :Show authorization error;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Edit Task;
  if (Mark Completed?) then (Yes)
    :Set status = COMPLETED;
  endif
  :Validate data;
  :Save changes;
  :Update statistics;
  :Show success message;
endif
stop
@enduml
AD04 – Search / Filter / Sort
UC13 hiển thị Task; UC14 Search và UC15 Filter/Sort mở rộng thao tác xem danh sách.
@startuml
title AD04 - Search / Filter / Sort Task
start
:Open Task list;
:Display user's Tasks;
if (Search / Filter / Sort?) then (Yes)
  :Enter keyword or select conditions;
  :Query Task data;
  if (Has results?) then (Yes)
    :Display results;
  else (No)
    :Show no-result message;
  endif
endif
stop
@enduml
AD05 – Set Reminder
UC16 thực hiện: chọn Task → kiểm tra quyền → bật Reminder → chọn thời điểm → kiểm tra → lưu → tạo Notification.
@startuml
title AD05 - Set Reminder
start
:Select Task;
:Check ownership;
:Enable Reminder;
:Select reminder time;
:Validate Reminder;
if (Valid?) then (Yes)
  :Save Reminder;
  :Create Notification;
  :Show success message;
else (No)
  :Show validation error;
endif
stop
@enduml
AD06 – Delete Account
UC24 giải quyết FR-07: User xác nhận xóa tài khoản, hệ thống xóa User và FK CASCADE xử lý dữ liệu phụ thuộc.
@startuml
title AD06 - Delete Account
start
:Open Account Settings;
:Select Delete Account;
:Show warning;
if (Confirm?) then (No)
  :Cancel;
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Authenticate request;
  :Delete User;
  :ON DELETE CASCADE dependent data;
  :Show success message;
endif
stop
@enduml
5. Sequence Diagram
Mã	Sequence Diagram	Use Case
SD01	Login	UC02
SD02	Register	UC01
SD03	Create Task	UC10
SD04	Update Task	UC11
SD05	Delete Task	UC12
SD06	Search / Filter	UC14, UC15
SD07	Set Reminder	UC16

SD01 – Login
@startuml
title SD01 - Login
actor User
participant UserController
participant UserService
participant UserRepository
database MySQL
User -> UserController: login(email,password)
UserController -> UserService: authenticate()
UserService -> UserRepository: findByEmail(email)
UserRepository -> MySQL: SELECT User
MySQL --> UserRepository: User
UserRepository --> UserService: User
UserService -> UserService: verifyPassword()
UserService --> UserController: token/session
UserController --> User: Login success / error
@enduml
SD02 – Register
@startuml
title SD02 - Register
actor Guest
participant UserController
participant UserService
participant UserRepository
database MySQL
Guest -> UserController: register(data)
UserController -> UserService: validate(data)
UserService -> UserRepository: existsByEmail(email)
UserRepository -> MySQL: SELECT by email
MySQL --> UserRepository: result
UserRepository --> UserService: result
UserService -> UserRepository: save(User)
UserRepository -> MySQL: INSERT User
MySQL --> UserRepository: saved
UserRepository --> UserService: User
UserService --> UserController: success
UserController --> Guest: Registration success
@enduml
SD03 – Create Task
@startuml
title SD03 - Create Task
actor User
participant TaskController
participant TaskService
participant TaskRepository
participant NotificationService
participant NotificationRepository
database MySQL

User -> TaskController: createTask(data)
TaskController -> TaskService: createTask(data, userId)
TaskService -> TaskService: validateTask()
TaskService -> TaskRepository: save(Task)
TaskRepository -> MySQL: INSERT Task
MySQL --> TaskRepository: saved
TaskRepository --> TaskService: Task

alt Reminder enabled
    TaskService -> NotificationService: createNotification()
    NotificationService -> NotificationRepository: save(Notification)
    NotificationRepository -> MySQL: INSERT Notification
    MySQL --> NotificationRepository: saved
    NotificationRepository --> NotificationService: Notification
    NotificationService --> TaskService: success
end

TaskService --> TaskController: result
TaskController --> User: success
@enduml
SD04 – Update Task
@startuml
title SD04 - Update Task
actor User
participant TaskController
participant TaskService
participant TaskRepository
database MySQL
User -> TaskController: updateTask(taskId,data)
TaskController -> TaskService: updateTask()
TaskService -> TaskRepository: findById(taskId)
TaskRepository -> MySQL: SELECT Task
MySQL --> TaskRepository: Task
TaskService -> TaskService: checkOwnership()
TaskService -> TaskService: validateTask()
TaskService -> TaskRepository: save(Task)
TaskRepository -> MySQL: UPDATE Task
MySQL --> TaskRepository: updated
TaskRepository --> TaskService: Task
TaskService --> TaskController: success
TaskController --> User: Updated
@enduml
SD05 – Delete Task
@startuml
title SD05 - Delete Task
actor User
participant TaskController
participant TaskService
participant TaskRepository
database MySQL
User -> TaskController: deleteTask(taskId)
TaskController -> TaskService: deleteTask(taskId,userId)
TaskService -> TaskRepository: findById(taskId)
TaskRepository -> MySQL: SELECT Task
MySQL --> TaskRepository: Task
TaskService -> TaskService: checkOwnership()
TaskService -> TaskRepository: delete(taskId)
TaskRepository -> MySQL: DELETE Task
MySQL --> TaskRepository: deleted
TaskService --> TaskController: success
TaskController --> User: Deleted
@enduml
SD06 – Search / Filter
@startuml
title SD06 - Search / Filter
actor User
participant TaskController
participant TaskService
participant TaskRepository
database MySQL
User -> TaskController: search/filter/sort(criteria)
TaskController -> TaskService: query(criteria,userId)
TaskService -> TaskRepository: findByCriteria()
TaskRepository -> MySQL: SELECT Tasks WHERE user_id = currentUser
MySQL --> TaskRepository: results
TaskRepository --> TaskService: results
TaskService --> TaskController: results
TaskController --> User: Display results
@enduml
SD07 – Set Reminder
@startuml
title SD07 - Set Reminder
actor User
participant TaskController
participant TaskService
participant NotificationService
participant NotificationRepository
participant TaskRepository
database MySQL

User -> TaskController: setReminder(taskId, time)
TaskController -> TaskService: setReminder(taskId, time, userId)
TaskService -> TaskRepository: findById(taskId)
TaskRepository -> MySQL: SELECT Task
MySQL --> TaskRepository: Task
TaskRepository --> TaskService: Task

TaskService -> TaskService: checkOwnership()
TaskService -> TaskService: validateReminder()
TaskService -> NotificationService: createNotification()
NotificationService -> NotificationRepository: save(Notification)
NotificationRepository -> MySQL: INSERT Notification
MySQL --> NotificationRepository: saved
NotificationRepository --> NotificationService: Notification
NotificationService --> TaskService: success

TaskService --> TaskController: success
TaskController --> User: Reminder saved
@enduml
6. Class Diagram tổng thể
Class Diagram phản ánh kiến trúc Controller → Service → Repository → Entity và 6 bảng chính: Users, Categories, Tasks, Notifications, ActivityLogs, Settings. Business Rule về ownership/authorization được xử lý ở Service/Security layer; không ép toàn bộ Business Rule vào SQL.
@startuml
title Task Management System - Overall Class Diagram
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam linetype ortho

package "Controller Layer" {
    class UserController
    class CategoryController
    class TaskController
    class NotificationController
    class AdminController
}

package "Service Layer" {
    class UserService
    class CategoryService
    class TaskService
    class NotificationService
    class AdminService
}

package "Repository Layer" {
    interface UserRepository
    interface CategoryRepository
    interface TaskRepository
    interface NotificationRepository
    interface ActivityLogRepository
    interface SettingRepository
}

package "Entity Layer" {
    class User {
        +userId : Long
        +fullName : String
        +email : String
        +password : String
        +avatar : String
        +phone : String
        +role : Role
        +createdAt : LocalDateTime
        +updatedAt : LocalDateTime
    }

    class Category {
        +categoryId : Long
        +user : User
        +categoryName : String
        +description : String
        +createdAt : LocalDateTime
    }

    class Task {
        +taskId : Long
        +user : User
        +category : Category
        +title : String
        +description : String
        +priority : Priority
        +status : TaskStatus
        +deadline : LocalDateTime
        +reminderTime : LocalDateTime
        +createdAt : LocalDateTime
        +updatedAt : LocalDateTime
    }

    class Notification {
        +notificationId : Long
        +user : User
        +title : String
        +content : String
        +isRead : Boolean
        +createdAt : LocalDateTime
    }

    class ActivityLog {
        +logId : Long
        +user : User
        +action : String
        +description : String
        +ipAddress : String
        +createdAt : LocalDateTime
    }

    class Setting {
        +settingId : Long
        +user : User
        +theme : String
        +language : String
        +timezone : String
        +notificationEnabled : Boolean
    }

    enum Role {
        USER
        ADMINISTRATOR
    }

    enum TaskStatus {
        TODO
        IN_PROGRESS
        COMPLETED
    }

    enum Priority {
        LOW
        MEDIUM
        HIGH
    }
}

' Controller -> Service
UserController --> UserService
CategoryController --> CategoryService
TaskController --> TaskService
NotificationController --> NotificationService
AdminController --> AdminService

' Service -> Repository
UserService --> UserRepository
CategoryService --> CategoryRepository
TaskService --> TaskRepository
TaskService --> NotificationService
NotificationService --> NotificationRepository
AdminService --> UserRepository
AdminService --> ActivityLogRepository
AdminService --> SettingRepository

' Repository -> Entity
UserRepository ..> User
CategoryRepository ..> Category
TaskRepository ..> Task
NotificationRepository ..> Notification
ActivityLogRepository ..> ActivityLog
SettingRepository ..> Setting

' Entity relationships
User "1" -- "0..*" Category : owns
User "1" -- "0..*" Task : owns
Category "0..1" -- "0..*" Task : classifies
User "1" -- "0..*" Notification : receives
User "1" -- "0..*" ActivityLog : generates
User "1" -- "0..1" Setting : has

' Enum relationships
User --> Role
Task --> TaskStatus
Task --> Priority

@enduml
Entity	Database	Quan hệ
User	Users	1:N Categories; 1:N Tasks; 1:N Notifications; 1:N ActivityLogs; 1:0..1 Settings
Category	Categories	N:1 User; 1:N Tasks
Task	Tasks	N:1 User; N:0..1 Category
Notification	Notifications	N:1 User
ActivityLog	ActivityLogs	N:1 User
Setting	Settings	1:0..1 User; user_id UNIQUE

