FR-02	UC02 Login	AD01, SD01	UserController → UserService → UserRepository → Users
FR-09	UC10 Create Task	AD02, SD03	TaskController → TaskService → TaskRepository → Tasks
FR-10	UC11 Update Task	AD03, SD04	TaskController → TaskService → TaskRepository → Tasks
FR-11	UC12 Delete Task	—, SD05	TaskController → TaskService → TaskRepository → Tasks
